{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a new custom Shopify Online Store 2.0 section that closely matches the attached reference image.
    
    SECTION TITLE:
    - Add a large heading at the top: “Home Loves Green”.
    - Make the heading editable from the Shopify Theme Editor.
    - Use a dark green color and a clean, bold, modern font.
    - Allow the merchant to change the heading text, font size, color, and alignment.
    
    PRODUCT SHOWCASE:
    - Create a horizontal product carousel displaying 3 product cards on desktop.
    - Products must be selected dynamically from a Shopify Collection Picker.
    - Do not hard-code product names, prices, images, ratings, or links.
    - Allow the merchant to select the collection from the Theme Editor.
    - Add a setting to control how many products are displayed.
    
    PRODUCT CARD DESIGN:
    - Use large product images at the top of each card.
    - Give the cards rounded corners.
    - Add a clean white card background with a subtle shadow.
    - Add generous spacing between cards.
    - Display the following product information:
      1. Optional “Bestseller” badge in the top-left of the image.
      2. Optional discount badge in the top-right showing the discount percentage.
      3. Product rating and review count.
      4. Product title.
      5. Short product description.
      6. Current product price.
      7. Compare-at/original price with strikethrough.
      8. Circular green add-to-cart button at the bottom-right.
    - Use the actual Shopify product data wherever available.
    - Product image should have a smooth hover zoom effect.
    - Clicking the product card or product image should open that product’s Shopify product page.
    - Clicking the add-to-cart button should add the product to the cart without taking the customer away from the collection section.
    
    CAROUSEL:
    - Show exactly 3 product cards on desktop.
    - Show 2 product cards on tablet.
    - Show 1 product card on mobile.
    - Add circular previous and next arrow buttons on the left and right sides of the carousel.
    - Arrows should move through the products smoothly.
    - Enable touch/swipe functionality on mobile.
    - Make the carousel responsive with no horizontal page overflow.
    - If there are fewer products than the number of visible cards, do not create unnecessary empty cards.
    
    VIEW ALL PRODUCTS BUTTON:
    - Add a prominent “View All Products” button below the product carousel.
    - Make the button text editable in the Theme Editor.
    - Add a Shopify URL/link picker setting for the button.
    - The merchant must be able to select any Shopify collection, page, product, blog, or custom URL.
    - DO NOT hard-code the button URL.
    - When the customer clicks “View All Products”, redirect them to exactly the URL selected in the Theme Editor.
    - Default button text should be “View All Products”.
    - Style the button with a dark green background, white text, rounded corners, and a smooth hover effect.
    - Allow button alignment to be changed between left, center, and right.
    
    BACKGROUND:
    - Add Theme Editor settings to either:
      - Select a background color, OR
      - Upload/select a background image.
    - If a background image is selected, display it as the section background.
    - Add controls for background image position, size, and overlay opacity.
    - Default background should be a soft warm cream color similar to the reference image.
    
    THEME EDITOR SETTINGS:
    Include the following customizable settings:
    - Section heading
    - Heading font size
    - Heading color
    - Heading alignment
    - Product collection picker
    - Number of products
    - Show Bestseller badge
    - Show discount badge
    - Show rating
    - Show product description
    - Show compare-at price
    - Show add-to-cart button
    - View All Products button text
    - View All Products button link
    - Button alignment
    - Background color
    - Background image
    - Background image position
    - Background overlay
    - Card background color
    - Card border radius
    - Card shadow
    - Section top padding
    - Section bottom padding
    - Card gap
    
    DESIGN STYLE:
    - Closely follow the visual structure of the attached reference image.
    - Use a premium, modern indoor-plant/e-commerce aesthetic.
    - Use dark green, cream, white, and subtle yellow/green accents.
    - Keep the layout spacious, clean, and elegant.
    - Do not copy any text or product information from the reference image.
    - The design should look like a professional Shopify plant-store product section.
    
    TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS:
    - Build it as a completely independent Shopify Online Store 2.0 section.
    - Use Liquid, HTML, CSS, and JavaScript only where necessary.
    - Use Shopify's collection and product objects.
    - Use Shopify's native URL setting/link picker for the “View All Products” button.
    - Do not hard-code product URLs.
    - Do not hard-code collection URLs.
    - All important content and styling must be editable through the Shopify Theme Editor.
    - Make the section compatible with Shopify's current theme architecture.
    - Ensure the section works correctly on desktop, tablet, and mobile.
    - Do not modify or depend on other theme sections.
    - Make sure the generated code is valid and can be saved directly as a Shopify section.
    , Create a new custom Shopify section inspired by the provided reference image.
    
    SECTION TITLE:
    - Add an editable heading at the top: “Home Loves Green”
    - Allow the heading text, font size, font weight, alignment, and color to be edited from the Shopify Theme Editor.
    
    PRODUCT CAROUSEL:
    - Create a responsive product carousel displaying 3 product cards on desktop.
    - Display 2 cards on tablet and 1 card on mobile.
    - Add left and right circular navigation arrows.
    - Keep the clean, premium plant-store aesthetic shown in the reference image.
    - Add smooth horizontal sliding/scrolling between products.
    - Make the section fully responsive.
    
    PRODUCT CARD:
    Each product card must support the following editable settings through the Shopify Theme Editor:
    1. Product image upload
    2. Product name/title
    3. Product subtitle/short description
    4. Current price
    5. Original/compare-at price
    6. Discount percentage badge
    7. Bestseller badge with option to enable/disable
    8. Star rating
    9. Review count
    10. Product page URL/link
    11. Cart button
    12. Product image aspect ratio
    13. Card background color
    14. Text colors
    15. Border radius
    16. Card spacing
    
    IMAGE:
    - Allow each product card to have its own image upload option.
    - Images should fill the image area neatly without distortion.
    - Add an optional image hover effect such as a subtle zoom.
    - Do not force the user to use Shopify product images; manually uploaded images should also be supported.
    
    RATINGS:
    - Add editable star ratings from 1 to 5.
    - Allow the rating value to be changed independently for every product.
    - Allow the review count to be edited independently.
    - Example: “★ 4.8 | 440”
    - Make the rating badge visually similar to the reference.
    
    PRICE:
    - Make the current price and original price fully editable for every product.
    - Display the original price with a strikethrough.
    - Allow the currency symbol to be edited.
    - Allow the discount percentage to be manually entered or optionally calculated from the two prices.
    
    PRODUCT LINKS:
    - Add an editable URL field for every product card.
    - Clicking the product image, product title, or card should redirect to that product's respective page.
    - Add a separate editable “View Product” link/button option if needed.
    - Make sure each product can have a different destination URL.
    
    CART BUTTON:
    - Keep a circular cart icon button at the bottom-right of every product card, similar to the reference image.
    - Clicking it should add that specific product to the Shopify cart.
    - The cart button should work independently for each product.
    - Allow the cart icon size, background color, and icon color to be customized.
    
    VIEW ALL PRODUCTS BUTTON:
    - Add a prominent “View All Products” button beside the cart/navigation area, matching the position and style requested.
    - Place it toward the bottom/right side of the product carousel, next to the circular cart/navigation control area.
    - Make the button clearly visible but visually consistent with the design.
    - Add a Theme Editor setting for the button text.
    - Add an editable URL setting for the button.
    - Clicking “View All Products” must redirect to the selected Shopify collection/products page.
    - Allow the button background color, text color, border radius, font size, padding, and hover effect to be customized.
    
    BADGES:
    - Add small rounded badges at the top of each product image.
    - Support “Bestseller” badge.
    - Support discount badge such as “15% OFF”.
    - Allow both badges to be independently enabled/disabled.
    - Allow badge text and colors to be edited.
    
    DESIGN:
    - Use a soft cream/off-white section background similar to the reference.
    - Use dark green typography for the main heading.
    - Use rounded product cards with subtle shadows.
    - Keep the design modern, clean, premium, and plant/nature focused.
    - Add generous spacing around the section.
    - Preserve the visual hierarchy of the reference image without copying any copyrighted text or branding.
    
    SHOPIFY THEME EDITOR SETTINGS:
    Create settings for:
    - Section heading
    - Section background color
    - Heading color
    - Heading size
    - Number of products/cards
    - Products per row
    - Card spacing
    - Image height/aspect ratio
    - Card radius
    - Card shadow
    - Navigation arrow settings
    - View All Products button text
    - View All Products URL
    - View All Products button colors
    - View All Products button styling
    - Mobile layout
    - Tablet layout
    - Desktop layout
    
    PRODUCT BLOCKS:
    Make every product a separate repeatable Shopify block so I can add/remove/reorder products from the Theme Editor.
    
    Each product block should contain:
    - Product image upload
    - Product title
    - Subtitle
    - Current price
    - Original price
    - Discount text
    - Bestseller toggle
    - Rating
    - Review count
    - Product URL
    - Add-to-cart product selection
    - Individual styling options where appropriate
    
    IMPORTANT:
    - Do not hard-code the product information.
    - Everything must be editable through Shopify Theme Editor.
    - Use Shopify Liquid, HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.
    - Make the section compatible with Shopify Online Store 2.0.
